        '<strong>Paving bedding and levelling:</strong> grit',
      ],
      p: ['For structural work, always follow your engineer’s specification for materials and mixes.'],
    },
    {
      h: 'How much is 7 tons?',
      p: [
        'A 7-ton load of building sand is roughly 4 to 5 cubic metres; stone is a little denser, so 7 tons is slightly less volume. Tell us what you are building and we will help you estimate the number of loads so you don’t pay for more than you need.',
      ],
    },
    {
      h: 'Preparing for delivery',
      list: [
        'Choose a firm, flat tipping spot close to where the material will be used',
        'Make sure a large truck can reverse in and has room to lift its bin',
        'Check for overhead wires and low branches above the tipping spot',
        'Protect new paving with boards or a tarp if you can',
      ],
    },
  ]}
  faqs={[
    {q: 'How much does a load of building sand cost?', a: 'From R1100 per 7-ton load, depending on your delivery address.'},
    {q: 'How much does crusher stone cost?', a: 'From R1350 per 7-ton load of 13mm or 19mm crusher stone, depending on your address.'},
    {q: 'Do you deliver to Kariega and Despatch?', a: 'We deliver across Nelson Mandela Bay. Call with your address to confirm the delivery price.'},
    {q: 'Can you deliver sand and stone on the same day?', a: 'Yes, we can schedule both for your site. Ask when you book.'},
  ]}
